                {
                    "details": "E-FICS-v3 encodes an azurocidin signal peptide, a serine residue, a SUMO tag (Uniprot: Q12306\n1-94), an enterokinase cleavage site, a TGTGS linker, redesigned equine infectious anemia virus gp45 HR1 (QSNAESVQNHTFEVLNNTIRALELILRKLEILYEMILQLHE), a designed EVEAIQKAI linker, SARS-CoV-2 S residues 914-1131 (corresponding roughly to the HR1-CH-beta-H-CD region and with the D985A substitution), a threonine residue, SARS-CoV-2 S residues 703-833 (corresponding roughly to the beta-UH-SCR region), a designed linker (TIDKEK), redesigned equine infectious anemia virus gp45 HR2 (WKEWRKEMENLTKEIKETLEEARKTLKQAEETFKTPSSG), a GT linker, a second enterokinase cleavage site, a modified AVI tag (TGSLNDIFEAQKIEWHE), a QGS linker, and a C-terminal octahistidine tag",
